{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_18807","headline":"詶乐天七月一日夜即事见寄 · 刘禹锡","name":"詶乐天七月一日夜即事见寄","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"夜树风韵清，天河云彩轻。\n故苑多露草，隔城闻鹤鸣。\n摇落从此始，别离含远情。\n闻君当是夕，倚瑟吟商声。\n外物岂不足，中怀向谁倾。\n秋来念归去，同听嵩阳笙。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘禹锡","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_18807.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_18807","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}